OL,3,ATrump arrives to greet Xi in rare
OL,4,Aairport welcome to kick off three-day
OL,5,AUS visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has left the
OL,8,FWhite House to greet China's Xi Jinping
OL,9,Fin a rare airport welcome, which will
OL,10,Fkick off a three-day visit to the US
OL,12,FTariffs, AI, the Iran war and Taiwan
OL,13,Fare among the key issues the pair could
OL,14,Fdiscuss this week, but what does each
OL,15,Fside want?
OL,17,FAdding to the high-stakes state visit,
OL,18,Fa US-China trade agreement reached last
OL,19,Fyear is set to expire in November
